schema: spec-driven

context: |
  This repository uses OpenSpec as the canonical source for non-trivial change
  proposals, designs, task lists, and spec deltas.
  Agent session state lives in .agent/sessions/ and should reference OpenSpec
  changes instead of duplicating their full content.

rules:
  proposal:
    - State the user-visible goal and non-goals.
    - Link related agent session ids when work spans multiple sessions.
  design:
    - Capture architecture decisions that should outlive a single chat session.
    - Keep volatile progress updates in .agent/sessions/.
  tasks:
    - Include validation commands and checkpoint expectations for long-running work.

